---
source: crates/oxc_formatter_yaml/tests/fixtures/mod.rs
---
==================== Input ====================
# Bail-out 1 of 5: a comment inside the mapping's scope refuses the whole mapping.
#
# Comments are placed by a positional, monotonic cursor, so moving an entry past another
# entry would emit them against the wrong nodes. It is also what keeps this feature inside
# FORMATTER_POLICY.md's comment invariants: a comment must never cross user content, and
# reordering entries moves user content across a comment.
#
# `get` keeps source order below. Its sibling `post` has no comment and is ordered, which is
# what makes this a per-mapping refusal rather than a per-document one.
openapi: 3.0.0
paths:
  /p:
    get:
      responses: {}
      # this comment refuses `get`
      summary: s
      operationId: op
    post:
      responses: {}
      summary: s
      operationId: op

